        <mxCell id="n9" value="Fields the object carries::
objectId · measurementDeltaTime (±2047 ms)
position x, y — 0.01 m, in sender B's frame
position confidence x, y — 0.01 m
velocity x, y — 0.01 m/s
classification — passengerCar(5)
classConfidence — 1..101, where 101 means unavailable" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="106" width="430" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n10" value="Wire format::
one raw UPER-encoded message per UDP datagram,
with no GeoNetworking or BTP envelope — that stack
resides in the modem and is outside the project.
The nominal message occupies 58 bytes.
Distance is not transmitted: the receiver derives it
from the x and y offsets." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="326" width="430" height="178" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="unused" value="unused by design
containers 2, 3 and 4, and 14 optional object fields" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;fillColor=#f4f5f8;strokeColor=#6b6e7b;dashed=1;fontColor=#6b6e7b;fontSize=15.4;fontStyle=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="524" width="430" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
